<section class="vc-card mt-3"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Add payout bank details</h2></div><form class="vc-card-body" id="vac-bank-form" novalidate><p class="vc-help">Complete this before requesting a payout. Admin will verify your bank proof.</p><div class="vc-form-grid"><div class="vc-field"><label for="vac-beneficiary">Account holder name</label><input class="vc-input" id="vac-beneficiary" name="beneficiary" required minlength="2" maxlength="150" autocomplete="name"></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="vac-ifsc">IFSC</label><input class="vc-input" id="vac-ifsc" name="ifsc" required maxlength="11" autocomplete="off" placeholder="ABCD0123456"></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="vac-account-number">Account number</label><input class="vc-input" id="vac-account-number" name="account_number" required minlength="8" maxlength="18" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="vac-account-confirm">Confirm account number</label><input class="vc-input" id="vac-account-confirm" name="account_confirm" required minlength="8" maxlength="18" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="vc-field full"><label for="vac-bank-proof">Cancelled cheque or bank proof</label><input class="vc-input" id="vac-bank-proof" name="bank_proof" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,application/pdf" required></div></div><div class="vc-form-actions"><button class="vc-btn primary" type="submit">Save bank details</button></div></form></section>
<section class="vc-card mt-3"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Account security</h2></div><div class="vc-card-body"><p>Use the password reset link to change your password through the verified email flow. We never display your full bank account or tax identifiers here.</p><button type="button" class="vc-btn" id="vac-logout">Sign out of this device</button></div></section>
